cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Model Laboratory in research or teaching, please cite this software."
type: software
title: "Model Laboratory"
version: 1.17.0
date-released: 2026-09-02
authors:
  - family-names: "Mykhailenko"
    given-names: "Maksym"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0009-5987-7660"
abstract: >-
  Model Laboratory is a local-first native desktop environment for creating, analysing,
  preserving, and reproducing mathematical experiments through typed model, run, artifact,
  provenance, and experiment-bundle protocols.
keywords:
  - reproducible research
  - mathematical modelling
  - scientific software
  - research software
  - local-first software
  - computational science
license: Apache-2.0
